#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.sum.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.sum"
msgstr "cuda.tile.sum"

#: cuda.tile._stub.sum:1 of
msgid "Performs sum reduction on tile along the `axis`."
msgstr "沿指定轴对 Tile 执行求和归约。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.sum.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.sum:3 of
msgid "input tile."
msgstr "输入 Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.sum:5 of
msgid ""
"the axis for reduction. The default, `axis=None`, will reduce all of the "
"elements. For `argmin` and `argmax`, tuple of axis is not supported."
msgstr "要执行归约的轴。默认值 ``axis=None`` 表示归约所有元素。对于 ``argmin`` 和 ``argmax`` ，不支持传入轴元组。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.sum:9 of
msgid ""
"If true, preserves the number of dimension from the input tile. "
"rounding_mode (RoundingMode): The rounding mode for the operation, only "
"supported for float types, default is RoundingMode.RN when applicable. "
"flush_to_zero (const bool): If True, flushes subnormal inputs and results"
" to sign-preserving zero, default is False."
msgstr ""
"若为 True，则在输出中保留与输入 Tile 相同的维度数。 ``rounding_mode`` "
"(RoundingMode)：该操作的舍入模式，仅支持浮点类型；适用时默认为 ``RoundingMode.RN`` 。 "
"``flush_to_zero`` (const bool)：若为 True，则将次正规（subnormal）输入和结果刷零（保留符号），默认为 "
"False。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.sum.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: cuda.tile._stub.sum:15 of
msgid ""
".. rubric:: Examples  Reduce all axes.  .. testcode::     :template: "
"kernel_wrapper.py      tx = ct.arange(8, dtype=ct.int32).reshape((2, 4))"
"     print(\"input:\", tx)     print(\"reduced:\", ct.sum(tx, None))  .. "
"testoutput::      input: [[0, 1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6, 7]]     reduced: 28  "
"Reduce axis 1 and keepdims.  .. testcode::     :template: "
"kernel_wrapper.py      tx = ct.arange(8, dtype=ct.int32).reshape((2, 4))"
"     print(\"input:\", tx)     print(\"reduced:\", ct.sum(tx, 1, "
"keepdims=True))  .. testoutput::      input: [[0, 1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6, 7]]"
"     reduced: [[6], [22]]  Reduce axes (1, 2).  .. testcode::     "
":template: kernel_wrapper.py      tx = ct.arange(8, "
"dtype=ct.int32).reshape((2, 2, 2))     print(\"input:\", tx)     "
"print(\"reduced:\", ct.sum(tx, (1, 2)))  .. testoutput::      input: "
"[[[0, 1], [2, 3]], [[4, 5], [6, 7]]]     reduced: [6, 22]"
msgstr ""

#: cuda.tile._stub.sum of
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: cuda.tile._stub.sum:17 of
msgid "Reduce all axes."
msgstr "沿所有轴进行归约。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.sum:31 of
msgid "Reduce axis 1 and keepdims."
msgstr "沿轴 1 进行归约并保留维度（keepdims）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.sum:45 of
msgid "Reduce axes (1, 2)."
msgstr "沿轴 (1, 2) 进行归约。"

